Chapter I - Preliminary
1. Short title and commencement
(1) These directions shall be called the Reserve Bank of India (Non-Banking Financial Companies – Treatment of Wilful Defaulters and Large Defaulters) Directions, 2025.
(2) These directions shall come into force with immediate effect.
